config BR2_PACKAGE_KIWAMI_TAILSCALE
	bool "kiwami-tailscale"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_HOST_GO_TARGET_ARCH_SUPPORTS
	select BR2_PACKAGE_HOST_GO
	help
	  Tailscale (Settings > Network > Tailscale): one tailscaled binary with the CLI built in, tailscale a link to
	  it, the features the handheld doesn't use left out. Kernel mode with the tun module, netfilter left off.

	  Buildroot's own tailscale package is not to be used instead: it is older, and it switches netfilter on in
	  the kernel, which Banana keeps off.

	  https://github.com/tailscale/tailscale
